            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Player adında bir sınıf oluştur ve tanımının içinde <code>level</code> değişkenini yazdır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  level = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(level)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>class</code>, ardından <code>Player:</code> ve sonra <code>print</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>level</code>, <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
